<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-NICHIREI WOMEN'S SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NICHIREI WOMEN'S SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at the Nichirei international women's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding): 6-Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic) 6-1 6-4 8-Wang Shi-ting (Taiwan) beat Rika Hiraki (Japan) 6-1 6-3 Park Sung-hee (South Korea) beat Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2 Andrea Glass (Germany) beat Annabel Ellwood (Australia) 6-4 6-4 Rita Grande (Italy) beat Kyoko Nagatsuka (Japan) 6-4 2-6 6-2 Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Miho Saeki (Japan) 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
